  "description": "This charming seamless pattern collection features elegant watercolor bows, sweet cherries, strawberries, lemons, lavender sprigs, delicate florals, and vintage-inspired striped backgrounds in beautiful pastel color palettes. Inspired by the popular coquette aesthetic, cottagecore charm, and botanical watercolor artwork, these seamless patterns create a feminine and sophisticated look perfect for creative projects.\nPerfect for fabric, digital papers, scrapbooking, wrapping paper, packaging, wallpaper, stationery, journaling, sublimation, planner covers, and more. Seamless and high-quality, ideal for both personal and commercial use.\nYou Will Receive\n➤ 22 Individual JPEG Files\n👉 Features:\n➤ High-resolution watercolor fruit designs\n➤ (12×12) Inches, 300 DPI\n➤ Hand-painted bows, florals, and fruit elements\n➤ Vintage striped background designs\n➤ Seamless repeating patterns\n➤ Elegant coquette and cottagecore aesthetic\n➤ High-resolution quality\n➤ Suitable for print and digital use\n➤ Perfect for fabric, POD & craft projects\n➤ Trendy feminine watercolor style\n➤ JPEG format for wide compatibility with various digital and print projects\n👉 Follow to discover more awesome artwork & seamless patterns.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>This charming seamless pattern collection features elegant watercolor bows, sweet cherries, strawberries, lemons, lavender sprigs, delicate florals, and vintage-inspired striped backgrounds in beautiful pastel color palettes. Inspired by the popular coquette aesthetic, cottagecore charm, and botanical watercolor artwork, these seamless patterns create a feminine and sophisticated look perfect for creative projects.</p>\n<p>Perfect for fabric, digital papers, scrapbooking, wrapping paper, packaging, wallpaper, stationery, journaling, sublimation, planner covers, and more. Seamless and high-quality, ideal for both personal and commercial use.</p>\n<p>You Will Receive</p>\n<p>➤ 22 Individual JPEG Files</p>\n<p>👉 Features:</p>\n<p>➤ High-resolution watercolor fruit designs<br>\n➤ (12×12) Inches, 300 DPI<br>\n➤ Hand-painted bows, florals, and fruit elements<br>\n➤ Vintage striped background designs<br>\n➤ Seamless repeating patterns<br>\n➤ Elegant coquette and cottagecore aesthetic<br>\n➤ High-resolution quality<br>\n➤ Suitable for print and digital use<br>\n➤ Perfect for fabric, POD &amp; craft projects<br>\n➤ Trendy feminine watercolor style<br>\n➤ JPEG format for wide compatibility with various digital and print projects</p>\n<p>👉 Follow to discover more awesome artwork &amp; seamless patterns.</p>",
